{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-12-13 15:25:00', 'title': "COMERICA BANK'S MICHIGAN INDEX DECLINED THROUGH SEPTEMBER", 'text': "DALLAS , DEC. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE COMERICA MICHIGAN ECONOMIC ACTIVITY INDEX FELL AT A 3.9% ANNUALIZED PACE IN THE THREE MONTHS THROUGH SEPTEMBER. SEVEN OF THE INDEX'S NINE COMPONENTS WERE DOWN OVER THE PERIOD."}